  "scope": [
    "Eight serial primary compiles use ABBA/BAAB ordering and precise process completion. Screens, fixtures, tests, linking, builds and standalone probe work are excluded. Historical polling cohorts remain separate.",
    "Only private borrowed schema views and their callers change, preserving visitation/insertion order and existing pure canonicalization, errors and mutation invalidation. Owner-backed requests use PendingSchema; raw drafts retain their original finalization. Fresh source, shape, factory, ownership and visit proofs remain.",
    "Frontend and instruction means improve in both balanced blocks. Whole-compiler and process means are effectively flat and their block directions are mixed; no reliable overall compiler saving is established. Native/source-CFG, parsing, catalog and RSS adverse observations remain in full.",
    "Five focused production cache tests include uniquely-owned cached-success mutation, shared ownership/error repair and concurrent readers. Fourteen paired fixtures and every full source/bytecode/Object/metadata/final executable byte match. No scalar retirement or fresh runtime campaign is claimed.",
    "Two separate source-to-executable observations include fresh source analysis, program Object output, object handoff and final native linking. They reuse frozen adapter objects, exclude first-use adapter construction and are not a balanced improvement cohort.",
    "The standalone Cranelift boundary probe uses two synthetic native functions, local/imported calls, data references and a data relocation. It compares complete Object bytes, optimized IR and compiled metrics against serial publication for 1/2/4 workers, eight repeats each. All 24 pass. It is not a production Mech scheduler, deterministic competing-error proof or a Deflate parallel speedup measurement.",
    "The probe first fails direct linking because LLVM22 bitcode meets system LLVM15 LTO. Rebuilding the same probe with Rust ThinLTO succeeds; both setup observations remain. Compiler/probe/test executables are excluded and hash-pinned, all generated program/native-input bytes remain. Pure replay validates saved data without running compilers or timings.",
    "Parallel Mech compilation and sub-ten-second compilation remain unachieved. The architectural design still requires a one-worker production split and explicit phase-variant dependencies before scheduling."
  ],
